@startuml pkg_petits
title HydroModPy — Petits packages (discretization, config, schema, catalog)
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "discretization.time" {
  class TMeshConfig {
    + itmuni : str
    + genmtd : str
    + nper : int
    + from_toml(path) : TMeshConfig {static}
    + to_builder_kwargs() : dict
  }
  class TimeGrid <<dataclass, frozen>> {
    + time_units : str
    + perlen : ndarray
    + nstp : ndarray
    + datetimes : Tuple
  }
  class TmeshGenerator {
    - _config : TMeshConfig
    - _tmesh : TimeGrid
    + from_config(config) : TmeshGenerator {static}
    + run() : TimeGrid
  }
  TmeshGenerator *-- "1" TMeshConfig
  TmeshGenerator ..> TimeGrid : produit >

  class TMeshCaseScenarioConfig {
    + id : str
    + description : str
  }
  TMeshCaseScenarioConfig --|> TMeshConfig
  class TMeshCasesConfig {
    + scenarios : List<TMeshCaseScenarioConfig>
    + from_toml(path) : TMeshCasesConfig {static}
  }
  TMeshCasesConfig *-- "0..*" TMeshCaseScenarioConfig
}

package "config" {
  class WorkflowConfig {
    + mode : WorkflowMode
  }
  class HydroModPyConfig {
    + workflow : WorkflowConfig
    + workspace : WorkspaceConfig
    + geographic : GeographicConfig
    + domain : DomainConfig
    + data : DataManagersConfig
    + flow : FlowConfig
    + simulation : SimulationConfig
    + solver : SolverConfig
    + display : DisplayConfig
    + calibration : CalibrationConfig
    + from_toml(path) : HydroModPyConfig {static}
    + from_snapshot(snapshot, **overrides) : HydroModPyConfig {static}
  }
  HydroModPyConfig *-- "1" WorkflowConfig
  note bottom of HydroModPyConfig
    Racine de composition : agrège ~20 sections
    (une par package -- physics, spatial, solver,
    calibration, display, simulation...).
  end note

  class DynamicFlowExamples {
    + render(threshold, section_renderer) : List<str>
  }
  note bottom of DynamicFlowExamples
    Implémente le Protocol externe
    core.toml_io.DynamicFlowExamplesProvider --
    garde core/toml_io découplé de physics/spatial.
  end note
}

package "schema" {
  class ValidationResult <<dataclass, frozen>> {
    + valid : bool
    + path : str
    + error : str
    + warnings : List<str>
    + as_dict() : dict
  }
  ValidationResult ..> HydroModPyConfig : validate_field() parcourt >
}

package "catalog" {
  class InputsNamespace {
    - _workspace : Path
    - _catalog : Any
    + has_cache() : bool
    + list(variable, source) : DataFrame
    + find(variable, source) : Any
    + close() : void
  }
  note bottom of InputsNamespace
    Façade lecture-seule sur &lt;workspace&gt;/data/cache.duckdb,
    enveloppe data.registry.DataCatalogDuckDB (association).
    Sœur conceptuelle de ProjectDataAccessor mais scopée
    workspace plutôt que projet.
  end note
}

@enduml
